speechtext:
What was the price agreed upon or realized under (a) the 1940-41 bacon agreement; (b) the present bacon agreement, for each of the following pork products:	1. Wiltshire sides;
2.	box cuts, (a) hams and gammons, (b) fores, (c) rib in back, (d) middle, (e) tinned hams;
3.	offal or pluck, (a) livers, (b) kidneys, (e) tongues ?
